1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:11,143
Speaking, task one. Topic 11: Free time and hobbies. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer out loud.

2
00:00:11,833 --> 00:00:13,693
What do you do in your free time?

3
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:22,715
In my free time I read books, cook and go for walks.

4
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,234
Do you have a hobby?

5
00:00:30,633 --> 00:00:34,864
Yes, my hobby is fishing. I go to the river with a friend.

6
00:00:35,767 --> 00:00:37,389
How much free time do you have?

7
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,941
I have free time mainly in the evenings and on Sundays.

8
00:00:45,833 --> 00:00:47,855
Do you play a musical instrument?

9
00:00:53,267 --> 00:00:56,632
No, I don't, but I like listening to music.

10
00:00:57,533 --> 00:00:59,230
What music do you listen to?

11
00:01:04,633 --> 00:01:07,415
I mostly listen to pop and Ukrainian songs.

12
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,483
What did you do in your free time as a child?

13
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:19,235
As a child I played football and went to a dance club.

14
00:01:20,133 --> 00:01:22,467
What did you do in your free time last week?

15
00:01:27,867 --> 00:01:30,715
Last week I went to the cinema and saw a new film.

16
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,383
Do you have a new hobby?

17
00:01:38,767 --> 00:01:42,006
Yes, I've started photographing nature with my phone.

18
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:44,902
What will you do this evening?

19
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:52,839
This evening I'll read a book and listen to music.

20
00:01:53,733 --> 00:01:55,743
What hobby would you like to try?

21
00:02:01,133 --> 00:02:04,625
I'd like to try yoga because it's good for my back.

22
00:02:05,533 --> 00:02:15,717
Great! Practise topic 11 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
